    "guide_step1_desc": "Clean the skin area (such as the shoulder) with a damp wipe. Peel off the protective film from the patch's adhesive. Place the circular patch on the clean area and press firmly with your fingers to ensure the adhesion needed for continuous monitoring and the generation of critical alerts.",
    "guide_step2_title": "Linking",
    "guide_step2_desc": "Locate the serial number \"SN: VC-PE-1004\" or the QR code printed on the front of the patch. Go to the VITAL CARE platform, navigate to the \"Patients\" section and click the \"ADD PATCH\" button. In the form, enter the serial number in the \"PATCH CODE\" field and press \"ADD\" to activate the device and start real-time tracking.",
